(7686862, 1258629, 100773, '<td valign="top">For me it''s a shame that the white thing in the corner is there, and that the background is not completely black. Apart from that, this is a stunning photograph</td>', 'For me it''s a shame that the white thing in the corner is there, and that the background is not completely black. Apart from that, this is a stunning photograph', '2021-02-14 09:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
