(7686864, 1258705, 100773, '<td valign="top">I like this!</td>', 'I like this!', '2021-02-14 10:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7686865, 1258606, 100773, '<td valign="top">I find the lighting a bit boring, or maybe it''s lack of contrast. Maybe you even could go closer? It would still show that it''s a beautiful and old book, and with some more drama in the light and/or more contrast in your software, I think this would be more interesting.</td>', 'I find the lighting a bit boring, or maybe it''s lack of contrast. Maybe you even could go closer? It would still show that it''s a beautiful and old book, and with some more drama in the light and/or more contrast in your software, I think this would be more interesting.', '2021-02-14 10:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7686866, 1258462, 100773, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the crop here. I think you could''ve not cropped it, and leave more room for the black background, and include more off the bubble. Apoart from that, this is gorgeous</td>', 'I don''t like the crop here. I think you could''ve not cropped it, and leave more room for the black background, and include more off the bubble. Apoart from that, this is gorgeous', '2021-02-14 10:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7686867, 1258526, 100773, '<td valign="top">Clever title to the abstract. This idea has great potential, sadly I feel there''s something with the technical side to the photo that doesnt compliment the idea. I think the overall photo is to bright, especially the red, and it looks slightly unsharp (but that could be because of the brightness). One stop down, possibly two, and more contrast would do wonders I think.</td>', 'Clever title to the abstract. This idea has great potential, sadly I feel there''s something with the technical side to the photo that doesnt compliment the idea. I think the overall photo is to bright, especially the red, and it looks slightly unsharp (but that could be because of the brightness). One stop down, possibly two, and more contrast would do wonders I think.', '2021-02-14 10:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7686868, 1258959, 100773, '<td valign="top">The BW is stunning. I think you could''ve played with the composition some more thoug. To me it doesnt look like it''s swinging as much as it''s haning off centre. Maybe f the chain had come from the corher and the pendelum had been more towards the opposite corner, with a bend to the chain to indicate movement.</td>', 'The BW is stunning. I think you could''ve played with the composition some more thoug. To me it doesnt look like it''s swinging as much as it''s haning off centre. Maybe f the chain had come from the corher and the pendelum had been more towards the opposite corner, with a bend to the chain to indicate movement.', '2021-02-14 10:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
